Notes on the amd64-port branch
==============================

This file records things about this branch that cannot be seen by
looking at the tree alone.  (To be extended when the branch is published.)

Removed binaries without source
-------------------------------

Upstream tracks the compiled dis/ tree in git, and it contained modules
whose Limbo source is no longer in the tree.  They cannot be rebuilt,
neither for the 32-bit dis/ nor for the 64-bit dis64/, and nothing in
the tree loads them, so this branch removed them:

	dis/acme/guiwm.dis
	dis/alphabet/main/env.dis
	dis/alphabet/mktypeset.dis
	dis/auth/sign.dis
	dis/fs/join.dis		(built from /appl/cmd/fs/join.b, since removed)
	dis/fs/merge2.dis
	dis/lib/regexutils.dis
	dis/sh/shmk.dis

They are still in upstream's history.  To get one back:

	git show 36616fe5:dis/sh/shmk.dis > dis/sh/shmk.dis

(36616fe5 is the upstream master this branch started from.)
